  "lineage": "Coordinator must attach cleaned old-to-new history mapping before publication. No commits, pushes or history rewriting performed.",
  "dirtyInputs": "Excluded; only git show of the source revision was used.",
  "adaptations": [
    "Explicit host identity/title/builtFrom and host published-version/deployment ports replace app defaults and fetch URLs.",
    "Graph validator/render moved to pure TS; Node generation and dated owner scratch moved to separate TS entry.",
    "Optional exact artifact role/availability fields added without changing graph v1 edges.",
    "Unsafe provenance source links and malformed page trees rejected; late disposed completions ignored.",
    "About-only CSS exported; source external-link icon fallback accepts host injection.",
    "New release metadata/graph adapter retains explicit per-artifact owner mappings and caller-declared dependency-owner rules; shared and fork artifacts never inherit the host owner. Synthetic hashes in tests are fixtures only.",
    "Additive document, whenShown and createAbortController host ports avoid ambient browser dependencies when supplied; all panel/icon nodes use the host document, same-copy ancestor opening works across DOM realms, and legacy adapters retain existing behavior. Causal source and actual installed archive runtime/declaration fixtures are prepared, not executed under the source-only child lease."
  ],
